second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"When was South Hills High School established?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 106, \"text\": \"South Hills High School (Texas) South Hills High School is a 9-12 public high school in Fort Worth, Texas.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d00\", \"start\": 107, \"end\": 188, \"text\": \"It is one of 14 zoned high schools in the Fort Worth Independent School District.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d00\", \"start\": 189, \"end\": 250, \"text\": \"South Hills opened in August 1998 with only a freshman class.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d00\", \"start\": 251, \"end\": 315, \"text\": \"The first graduating class, and the first year of 9-12 was 2002.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d00\", \"start\": 316, \"end\": 427, \"text\": \"The original school consisted of buildings and property purchased from a private school, Trinity Valley School.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d00\", \"start\": 428, \"end\": 576, \"text\": \"Roughly 50 portable classrooms and the original Trinity Valley structures were used until a bond issue in 2000 allowed the school as it is now to be\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 600, \"text\": \"Related changes Permanent link Page information Concept URI Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Create a book Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikidata high school in Fort Worth , Texas , USA edit Language Label Description Also known as default for all languages No label defined – English South Hills High School high school in Fort Worth , Texas , USA Statements instance of high school 1 reference stated in Common Core of Data public school 0 references inception August 1998 0 references country United States 1\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 607, \"text\": \"Related changes Permanent link Page information Concept URI Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Create a book Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikidata high school in Fort Worth, Texas, USA edit Language Label Description Also known as default for all languages No label defined – English South Hills High School high school in Fort Worth, Texas, USA Statements instance of high school 1 reference stated in Common Core of Data public school 0 references inception January 2005 0 references country United States 1 reference\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 331, \"text\": \"South Hills High School (West Covina, California) South Hills High School (often known by its abbreviation, SHHS) is a public coeducational high school located in the hills in the eastern part of West Covina, California (although there is a common misconception that it is in Covina), east of Los Angeles in the San Gabriel Valley.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d03\", \"start\": 332, \"end\": 409, \"text\": \"South Hills High School is part of the Covina-Valley Unified School District.\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d03\", \"start\": 410, \"end\": 555, \"text\": \"South Hills opened in the fall of 1964, with incoming freshmen, as well as sophomore and junior transfers from Covina and Northview high schools.\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d03\", \"start\": 556, \"end\": 601, \"text\": \"Its first graduating class was in June, 1966.\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d03\", \"start\": 602, \"end\": 605, \"text\": \"The\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 180, \"text\": \"Public School • Equity Focus At Equity Focus Schools , more than 50 % of students are Black , Latino , and/or Native American , AND more than 50 % come from low-income households .\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d04\", \"start\": 181, \"end\": 361, \"text\": \"Learn more about our Equity Focus South Hills High School Contact info is sourced from our partners at MDR Education , and DonorsChoose updates our site ahead of each school year .\"}, \"D5S3\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d04\", \"start\": 362, \"end\": 569, \"text\": \"645 S Barranca St West Covina , CA 91791 http : //www.southhillshigh.com Projects Students Donations Teachers About this school South Hills High School is a suburban public school in West Covina , California\"}, \"D6S1\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0213-e49a09a28797:d05\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 645, \"text\": \"School Districts Best School Districts in America Best School Districts in California Best School Districts in Georgia Best School Districts in Ohio Best School Districts in Massachusetts Best School Districts in Michigan Best School Districts in Minnesota Best School Districts in New Jersey Best School Districts in New York Best School Districts in North Carolina Best School Districts in Pennsylvania Best School Districts in Texas Best School Districts in Virginia Best School Districts in Washington Best School Districts in Wisconsin Public High School